        {
          "label": "$2\\pi$",
          "why": "$e^{z+2\\pi}=e^{2\\pi}e^z\\ne e^z$。要加在虛部才是轉一圈。"
        },
        {
          "label": "沒有週期",
          "why": "$e^{2\\pi i}=\\cos 2\\pi+i\\sin 2\\pi=1$，所以 $e^{z+2\\pi i}=e^z$。"
